    h2 A Superpowered HTML Reset @137,370,440,21
    text With just the right amount of everything, Pico is a great starting point for a clean and lightweight design system. @137,403,440,41
    row @137,456,440,691
      col @137,497,50,608
        h3 Class-light and Semantic @137,497,50,56
        text Thriving on simplicity, Pico directly styles your HTML tags, using fewer than 10 .classes overall. It also comes with a class-less version for wild HTML purists. @137,565,50,447
        link "Discover the class-less version" /docs/classless @137,1024,50,81
      col @199,499,61,605
        h3 Great Styles with Just CSS @199,499,61,94
        text No extra baggage needed. Pico works seamlessly without dependencies, package managers, external files, or JavaScript, achieving elegant and straightforward styles with pure HTML markup. @199,605,61,446
        link "Get started" /docs @199,1063,61,41
      col @272,456,64,691
        h3 Responsive Everything @272,456,64,37
        text Effortless elegance on every device. Pico natively scales font sizes and spacings with screen widths, resulting in a consistent and elegant look across devices. No extra classes or configuration needed. @272,505,64,528
        link "Discover the responsive font sizes" /docs/typography @272,1045,64,102
      col @348,497,60,608
        h3 Light or Dark Mode @348,497,60,56
        text Pico comes with two accessible, neutral color schemes out of the box: light and dark. The best part? It automatically adapts to users' prefers-color-scheme, all without the use of JavaScript. @348,565,60,447
        link "Learn about the color schemes" /docs/color-schemes @348,1024,60,81
      col @420,466,67,671
        h3 Easy Customization @420,466,67,38
        text Customize Pico with over 130 CSS variables, or dive deeper by using SASS. Switch between 20 handcrafted color themes and compose with 30+ modular components to tailor the UI to your brand's look and feel. @420,516,67,527
        link "Learn about the CSS variables" /docs/css-variables @420,1055,67,82
      col @499,476,78,650
        h3 Optimized Performance @499,476,78,38
        text Speed meets elegance. Unlike bulky and overcomplicated frameworks that demand extensive class overrides and JavaScript, Pico keeps your HTML lean, decreases memory usage by avoiding excessive CSS specificity, and reduces loaded files. @499,526,78,568
        link "Quick start" /docs @499,1106,78,20
    h2 Embrace the Power of Less @137,1159,440,21
    text A strong design foundation thrives on simplicity and ease of maintenance. @137,1192,440,41
